may be able to avoid a panic by saying that it was a bug in the test data for

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:12.930
the next version fortunately the message boards didn't react as strongly as I had

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:18.590
expected with the case of the monsters coming down is the issue of Tsukasa also

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:20.640
fading away

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:43.240
what is it i have a favor to ask you're keeping your distance from Tsukasa but you need to stay

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:49.420
close there is still a need to investigate this bigger flow that Tsukasa got involved in something

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:54.130
that might eventually affect the foundation of the world at least that's the direction i've heard

00:06:54.130 --> 00:07:00.000
the knights are headed in so are you interested in the activities of the crimson knights not at all what i am

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.960
interested in is this bigger flow issue at this point you are the only one in the night's

