organization that even has an idea about how grave the situation is what are you trying to sell

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:14.980
i have no doubt that you're smart but i'm not sure if i like how you jump to conclusions

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:21.310
i don't see your point with this exactly i'm asking these things with that in mind

